# Comment style

Never use semicolons in comments (`#`, `##`, `//`, `/* */`, or docstrings).

Split the thought into two sentences, or rephrase with a comma, dash, or period.

```gdscript
# BAD
# Segment-row hover shares this layer; do not erase its tiles.

# GOOD
# Segment-row hover shares this layer. Do not erase its tiles.
```
